    <item>
      <title>1.6.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 02:04:32 +0530</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:0 2px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:10px 0 4px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:3px 0}</style><h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Runs on Intel Macs too.</strong> NotchFun now works on the Intel Macs that run macOS Tahoe, not only on Apple Silicon.</li>
<li><strong>See how long Caffeine has left.</strong> A timed session counts down beside the cup; switch it off in Settings → Caffeine if you'd rather not.</li>
<li><strong>Updates itself.</strong> New versions download quietly and install the next time you quit. You can turn this off in Settings → About.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>A friendlier setup.</strong> Clearer next steps on every screen, a hello from the notch, and Launch at login switched on for you.</li>
<li><strong>A lighter, livelier notch.</strong> Slimmer icons, a little bounce when the volume popup appears, and play and pause animate.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Slow drags open the shelf.</strong> Dragging a file up gently on a trackpad sometimes didn't open the notch; now it always does.</li>
<li><strong>The mirror opens on the first click.</strong> It sometimes needed two, and could be slow to respond.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/lookatsarthak/NotchFun/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
