    <item>
      <title>1.5.1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 01:57:13 +0530</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:0 2px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:10px 0 4px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:3px 0}</style><h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Cleaner quitting.</strong> NotchFun now shuts down properly at log out and during updates, so nothing it was about to save is lost.</li>
<li><strong>Smoother notch.</strong> Hovering, dragging and pressing volume keys redraw far less of the open notch.</li>
<li><strong>Settings apply instantly.</strong> A changed setting shows in the notch straight away.</li>
<li><strong>Keyboard shortcuts work better on macOS 27.</strong></li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>The Now Playing helper no longer keeps running</strong> after NotchFun quits.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
